QA3 M2. Two deferred closures wrap the named result, one in a *W3 and one with
fmt.Errorf; at run time F1 returns the Errorf Wrap of the *W3 of io.EOF, and
errors.Unwrap of it is the *W3. The value read back around the cycle of stores
is io.EOF under "any number of the cycle's Wraps": unwrapping it gives that
leaf under each Wrap of the cycle, so *W3.Unwrap shows in a Wrap Chain.
